WEBVTT

00:19:28.846 --> 00:19:31.704
This is where the Marines
in the audience get kind of tense.

00:19:31.728 --> 00:19:37.822
(Laughter)

00:19:37.846 --> 00:19:40.704
And this is when they think
about beating the crap out of me

00:19:40.728 --> 00:19:41.822
after the talk.

00:19:41.846 --> 00:19:42.822
(Laughter)

00:19:42.846 --> 00:19:44.822
Read Max Boon.

00:19:44.846 --> 00:19:46.822
This is the history of the marines
-- small wars, small arms.

00:19:46.846 --> 00:19:48.822
The Marines are like my West
Highland Terrier.

00:19:48.846 --> 00:19:51.227
They get up every morning,
they want to dig a hole

00:19:51.251 --> 00:19:52.822
and they want to kill something.

00:19:52.846 --> 00:19:54.822
(Laughter)

00:19:54.846 --> 00:19:57.822
I don't want my Marines handing out aid.

00:19:57.846 --> 00:19:59.846
I want them to be Marines.